h264_mmal encoder: H.264 encoding on the VideoCore through MMAL

libavcodec/mmalenc.c (from the haiku-rpi repository's patches/ffmpeg6/files):
an "h264_mmal" encoder on vc.ril.video_encode, the Raspberry Pi's hardware
H.264 encoder (up to 1920x1088; yuv420p in, copied into the VideoCore's
buffers). FFmpeg 6.1 has an MMAL decoder only. Bit rate (-b, default 4M), key
frame interval (-g, default 60), profile (-profile: baseline, main, high: the
default); the parameter sets in-band before each key frame (option
inline_headers) and the first ones also as AV_PKT_DATA_NEW_EXTRADATA.

  configure      h264_mmal_encoder needs mmal
  Makefile       mmalenc.o
  allcodecs.c    ff_h264_mmal_encoder, after the other H.264 encoders (the
                 default H.264 encoder only in a build without libx264 or
                 another one, as ours)

LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the files it changes.

diff -ruN a/configure b/configure
